ul.li:
Documentation: a short README, and the rest in docs/: supported devices, usage,
          the command line, troubleshooting, privacy and security, other ways to install;
          CONTRIBUTING.md for tests and translations.

Preferences → Storage: the cache is split into maps, software updates, pictures
          and temporary files, each with its size and its own clear button;
          openexpress cache --clear --only … in the CLI.
